# Vendored sandcastle loop code — the repo-root .prettierignore already lists
# `.sandcastle/`, but prettier resolves ignore files against the CURRENT WORKING
# DIRECTORY. A session, subagent or post-edit hook running from inside this
# folder never reads the root file, finds only `.sandcastle/.gitignore` (which
# does not list source), and happily reformats `main.mts` — 374 KB, whose entire
# import block then gets rewritten by @ianvs/prettier-plugin-sort-imports.
#
# That is exactly what happened in fb86427c: ~35 lines of real logic buried
# under 376 lines of import churn, reverted in e425623f.
#
# This file makes the protection CWD-independent. Do not delete it. If
# /sandcastle-update overwrites this directory, re-graft it.
